    <div class="section-box">
        <h2>2. Visual Quality & Layout Issues</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Critical Missing Content (Calculator):</strong> The prompt specifically asks for a "Solar Calculator section". This screenshot displays a Portfolio/Case Study grid instead. There are no inputs, sliders, or calculation results present.</li>
            <li><strong>Broken Image Placeholders:</strong> All 6 portfolio cards contain large, blank light-gray rectangles where hero images of solar installations should be. This looks like a loading failure or missing asset state.</li>
            <li><strong>Excessive Whitespace:</strong> There is a massive vertical gap between the top dark banner and the "Portfolio" heading. This suggests a missing Hero Section or Calculator Section that was supposed to sit there.</li>
            <li><strong>Color Palette Mismatch:</strong> The design relies heavily on grayscale (White, Black, Light Gray). There is almost no usage of the required brand colors:
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Deep Green:</strong> Absent (used for trust/nature).</li>
                    <li><strong>Solar Yellow/Warm Gold:</strong> Absent (used for energy/highlights).</li>
                </ul>
                The only accent is a generic blue link at the bottom.
            </li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- 3. Calculator Form Status -->
    <div class="section-box">
        <h2>3. Calculator Form Rendering Status</h3>
        <p><strong>Status: NOT RENDERING / MISSING</strong></p>
