        <h2>6. Layout Breakage at 1440px</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>The grid layout (3 columns) seems stable and centered.
            <li>However, the <strong>vertical rhythm is broken</strong>. The huge gap at the top indicates that the page flow is likely incorrect or components are hidden/failing to render in that space.</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- 7. Specific Fixes -->
    <div class="section-box">
        <h2>7. Specific Concrete Fixes Required</h2>
        <ol>
            <li><strong>Insert Solar Calculator:</strong> You have provided a Portfolio grid. Replace or prepend the <strong>Solar Calculator</strong> component here. It needs inputs for electricity usage and roof size.</li>
